__EVENTS__
Events
| where EventType == 'http_summary'
| summarize Requests=sum(Count), Failures=sum(Failures), TotalDurationMs=sum(DurationMs), MaxLatencyMs=max(MaxDurationMs)
    by Operation, StatusClass
| extend MeanLatencyMs=TotalDurationMs / Requests
| project-away TotalDurationMs
| order by Requests desc
